    "revision_evidence": [
      "f_readdir clears fno->fname[0] before DIR_READ_FILE, a fix introduced in R0.16",
      "get_fileinfo clears fno->fname[0] on entry, a fix introduced in R0.16",
      "FILINFO created-date and created-time fields require R0.15b or later independently",
      "check_fs retains the base R0.16 128-sector minimum and has none of patch 1's small-cluster rejection",
      "mount_volume has neither patch 2's minimum exFAT cluster-count check nor its maximum FAT-size check"
